From dcfc63427e4650d77e42cbe79aa04c902e176e83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:32:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LV4: mechanic kit B (environment and light), per-level view
 distance

levels_mech_env.c: fog zones with valves, the glum tide, lantern and candles, the Wall's two faces,
showtime light swap, collapsing floors, dissolving rooms; every cell rebuilt from the definition plus
the state, so restores are exact. New zone kinds candle / show / collapse. DoomoView3D.view_dist
(header key view) in the native raycaster (matching light fall-off) and the GBA r3d.c (r3f.maxd, sprite
cull); PS1 compiled out until PS1-RAM. GBA RAM identical, speed tour frame-exact. 15 host tests incl.
the renderer at 240x160 and 320x240.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cz7PBDFwYoagK8oCML
